		{
			"id":"5f5e30b69246d885",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"There is a theme of distance between feet on this room drawings.\n\nLike there is a gap between two feets and this is represented by a line with arrows.\n\nOne of the candlelights can be pulled to reveal a locked safe. \n\nOne of the theories for the Safe Code is to count the number of pictures that are the same and interpret that as the number and the distance between feet as the order.\n\nThere are five pictures:\n\nKid - 4 Pictures to the Right - 1 to the Left\nWoman - 2 Pictures to the Right - 2 to the Left\nHorse - 3 Right - 3 Left\nMan\n- 1 Right\n- 1 Left\n- 1 Left\n- Split\n- 1 Right (3 Man)\n- 1 Right\n- Split\n- 1 Right\n- 1 Right\n- 1 Left\n- Split\n- 1 Left\n\nOld Man\n- 1 Left\n- 1 Left (3)\n- 1 Left\n- Split\n- 1 Left (3)\n- Split\n- 1 Right\n- 1 Right\n- 1 Right\n- 1 Right\n- 1 Left (3)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-680,
			"y":-2560,
			"width":1020,
			"height":1780
		},
		{
			"id":"16133adff3800f34",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Old Man - Smallest Step - 9\nWoman - 4\nMan - 9\nKid - 5\nHorse - 6\n\nOld Man - 1\nWoman - 0\nMan - 1\nKid - 3\nHorse - 0\n\nOld Man - -11 + 4 = -7\nWoman - 0\nMan - 3\nKid - 3\nHorse - 0\n\n\nOld Man - 15\nWoman - 4\nMan - 11\nKid - 5\nHorse - 6",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1280,
			"y":-2300,
			"width":520,
			"height":580
		},
		{
			"id":"400055a853a4c7c9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"If I think about this room as a rotary telephone\n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1860,
			"y":-2240,
			"width":520,
			"height":400
		}
